raw_text = "~ stage_2_1
brother : mom.... dad..... it’s been a while.... 
brother : i’m sorry i can’t come here frequent enough... i need to take care of sella.... 
brother : hiks-hiks.... oh no... i need to be strong, sella needs me
entity : Don’t cry my child....
brother : who is that??!!!
=> END

~ stage_2_2
brother : what in the hell are you....
entity : it does not matter. what matter is, I know the way to cure your little sister.
brother : there is no way, not even the best doctor in town could cure her.
entity : they couldn’t. not without magic.
brother : (thinking).......
brother : what should i do?......
entity : go to the sea, find the sarifice fish and then come back to me.
brother : sacrifice fish?....
entity : .......
brother : hey? why are you not answering me?
entity : .......
brother : fine..... i just need to bring that here right...
=> END"
